  "given_answer": "9",
  "answer": "9",
  "given_solution": "【分析】先根据绝对值和完全平方的非负性求出x和y的值，再代入\\(y ^ { x }\\)中计算即可.\n【详解】\\(\\because \\left | { x-2 } \\right |+\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } =0\\)，且\\(\\left | { x-2 } \\right |\\ge 0，\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } \\ge 0,\\)\n\\(\\therefore \\left | { x-2 } \\right |=0，\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } =0,\\)\n\\(\\therefore x=2，y=-3,\\)\n\\(\\therefore y ^ { x } =(-3) ^ { 2 } =9\\)\n故答案为：9\n【点睛】本题主要考查了绝对值和完全平方的非负性，几个非负数的和为0，则每一个数都为0.掌握以上知识是解题的关键.",
  "given_solution_figures": [],
  "solution": "\\(\\because \\left | { x-2 } \\right |+\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } =0\\)，且\\(\\left | { x-2 } \\right |\\ge 0，\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } \\ge 0,\\)\n\\(\\therefore \\left | { x-2 } \\right |=0，\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } =0,\\)\n\\(\\therefore x=2，y=-3,\\)\n\\(\\therefore y ^ { x } =(-3) ^ { 2 } =9\\)\n故答案为：9",
  "solution_steps": [
    "\\(\\because \\left | { x-2 } \\right |+\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } =0\\)，且\\(\\left | { x-2 } \\right |\\ge 0，\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } \\ge 0,\\)",
    "\\(\\therefore \\left | { x-2 } \\right |=0，\\left ( { y+3 } \\right ) ^ { 2 } =0,\\)",
    "\\(\\therefore x=2，y=-3,\\)",
    "\\(\\therefore y ^ { x } =(-3) ^ { 2 } =9\\)",
    "故答案为：9"
  ],
